  "instructions": "<ol><li>In a medium pot, melt butter over medium heat.</li><li>Cut onion into 4 wedges and add to the pot along with the canned tomatoes and vegetable broth. </li><li>Bring to a simmer. </li><li>Simmer, uncovered, for about 40 minutes. Stir occasionally.</li><li>Blend the soup with an immersion blender and season to taste.</li><li>If you happen to have fresh basil on hand, throw in a handful before blending.</li></ol>"
